msgid ""
"The realm of destinations you seek has eluded our grasp, spirited away by "
"elusive knomes. Rally the grid managers, let them venture forth to curate a "
"grand tapestry of remarkable places for your exploration!"
msgstr ""
"Yr ystafellau o cyrchfannau rydych chi'n eu chwilio amdanynt wedi eu dwyn "
"oddi ar ein gafael, wedi'u cludo i ffwrdd gan gnomes anhysbys. Raliwch y "
"rheolwyr grid, gadewch iddynt anturio ymlaen i guradu taflen fawr o leoedd "
"rhyfeddol ar gyfer eich archwilio!"

